    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκοσμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>adorn yet more, add ornament to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					5.13.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξόανα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					798.20
				</span></i>
			 (Cyzicus, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφειδέσι δαπάναις π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.575
			</span></i>: also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν προσκεκοσμημένων τῷ
				θεάτρῳ</span> the <i>adornments added to</i> the theatre,
			prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				66
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκοσμ-</span> is 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεις κοσμ-</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.316d
			</span></i>).</div>
